# Tenacious Tomeseeker: "Bargain. When this creature enters, if it was bargained, return target instant or sorcery card from your
# graveyard to your hand." Bot1 casts Opt (turn 1) and Preordain (turn 3), then the Tomeseeker, bargaining by sacrificing Mox Jet.
# The sacrifice is paid with the cost (CR 601.2h), so Mox Jet is in the graveyard when the trigger is put on the stack, but an
# artifact card is not an instant or sorcery card: it is refused as the target. Either the instant or the sorcery is a legal
# target (CR 115.1); Bot1 chooses the sorcery, and the Opt stays in the graveyard.

